    "body": "Displayed numbers now use one shared comma-grouping component. FF8 Item Buy/Sell values, calculated Sell Price, Weapon Upgrade Price, shared table cells, and numeric reference values now show forms such as 1,000 and 20,000. Number inputs remain raw while editing because browser number fields reject commas. The shared numeric style also stabilizes digit spacing. Hidden-window checks passed with no overflow.",
